    "location": "html-block:74",
    "text": "Overview",
    "heading": "PowerLogic ION7550 RTU"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:75",
    "text": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:76",
    "text": "The PowerLogic ION7550 RTU (remote terminal unit) is an intelligent, web-enabled device ideal for combined utilities metering of water, air, gas, electricity and steam (WAGES). The device collects, scales, and logs readings from a large number of connected meters or transducers and delivers the information to one or more head-end systems through a unique combination of integrated communication gateways. Characteristics",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:77",
    "text": "Up to 10 Mbytes of memory",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:78",
    "text": "One pulse output",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:79",
    "text": "24 digital or analogue inputs (max)",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:80",
    "text": "30 digital or analogue outputs (max, including pulse output)",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:81",
    "text": "Ethernet port (Modbus/TCP/IP protocol)",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:82",
    "text": "Modbus TCP Master / Slave on Ethernet port",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:83",
    "text": "Optical port",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:84",
    "text": "RS 485 port",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:85",
    "text": "RS 485 / RS 232 port",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:86",
    "text": "Modbus RTU Master / Slave (Serial port)",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:87",
    "text": "Internal modem",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:88",
    "text": "Modem gateway (ModemGate)",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:89",
    "text": "DNP 3.0 through serial, modem, and I/R ports",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:90",
    "text": "Alarm notification via email (Meterm@il)",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:91",
    "text": "HTML web page server (WebMeter)",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:92",
    "text": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:93",
    "text": "You can reduce waste and optimize equipment operation to increase energy efficiency. Featuring a large, intuitive display; extensive digital and analog I/O; and the overall versatility of the PowerLogic system, the ION7550 RTU provides a cost-effective, dedicated WAGES solution when compared to a traditional meter.",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:94",
    "text": "Applications"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:95",
    "text": "WAGES (water, air, gas, electricity, steam) metering",
    "heading": "Applications"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:96",
    "text": "Integrated utility metering with advanced programmable math functions",
    "heading": "Applications"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:97",
    "text": "Data concentration through multi-port, multi-protocol communications",
    "heading": "Applications"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:98",
    "text": "Equipment status monitoring and control",
    "heading": "Applications"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:99",
    "text": "Programmable set points for out-of-limit triggers or alarm conditions",
    "heading": "Applications"
  },
